          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: नम्रता",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नम्रता (namratā) — \"humility\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नम्रता (namratā) is humility — bendingness, the quality of one who bows."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It stands on nam, \"to bow\", which is the nam that opens नमस्ते on your first page and sits inside प्रणामः. Those two are single acts; नम्रता (namratā) is the same bow turned into a settled habit."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Hindi namratā is the word people still use of someone who carries success lightly."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The bow you already make, become a habit."
            }
          ]
        },
